export anchor AccountingLedgerStyle:
    number: 169
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Accounting ledger
    idea: The dashboard is a page of a green bookkeeping ledger, with ruled columns, black and red ink, projects kept as accounts with double-underlined totals, a tally of completed tasks and thumb-index tabs down the edge.
    base: light
    palette:
        binding: #e6e2d6, the page behind the book
        ledgerGreen: #eef5e6, the leaf
        lineGreen: #c6dcc0, horizontal rulings every 32px, never text
        columnGreen: #8fb98c, money column rules
        headGreen: #2f5a33, column heads, section heads and the On track tick
        blackInk: #1a1d1a, entries, figures and totals
        softInk: #46503f, dates, departments and notes
        redInk: #ad1f1a, the Behind account row and overdue figures
        umber: #7a4a00, At risk
        marginRed: #d77a73, the double margin rule, never text
        tabCream: #f8f4e6, thumb-index tabs
        focus: #1f4fbf, the focus ring
    type:
        Entries use Baskerville, Libre Baskerville, Baskerville Old Face,
        Book Antiqua, Palatino, Georgia with lining tabular figures.
        Labels use Gill Sans, Gill Sans MT, Seravek, Trebuchet MS,
        system-ui. Total figures are 40px regular, the greeting 30px
        italic, the book title 30px small caps tracked 0.06em in head
        green, account names 17px, body 16px at 1.5, and column heads
        11 to 13px sans caps tracked 0.1em.
    layout:
        A ledger leaf with a red double margin rule 52px in and green
        ruled lines every 32px, with six cream thumb-index tabs standing
        off its right edge as the nav, Home flush with the leaf. The top
        has the title Brightwork General ledger of projects, a Folio 31
        caption, a Find field, a black Open new project button, a bell and
        Keeper Mara Okafor, over a double green rule. An entry line gives
        the date in caps, the greeting in italic with a note, and a red
        clock Overdue 4 tasks flag. A trial balance strip shows the four
        totals right aligned in columns, each figure double underlined,
        the overdue one in red. The project accounts table has folio,
        account, department, Done, Left and Total money columns, percent,
        due date and status, with Billing migration written in red and a
        totals row single ruled above and double ruled below. Below sit a
        tally of tasks completed, one row per day drawn in tally marks of
        five with the count right aligned and weekly subtotals double
        underlined, and a day journal with time, particulars and initials.
        Below 900px the tabs move to a scrolling row above the leaf and
        the table and tally scroll sideways.
    spacing: An 8px unit on a 32px ruled line. Rows are 48px, sections 32px apart, an 80px left margin for the red double rule.
    density: Medium. Tabular and orderly, figures right aligned in narrow money columns.
    corners: Square leaf. Index tabs round 8px on their outer edge, buttons 2px.
    borders: A double rule under the title, 2px green under column heads, 1px column rules, a single rule over and a double rule under every total.
    shadows: Two stacked 2px page edges under the leaf. Tabs cast a 2px flat edge.
    icons:
        Bookkeeper marks beside words. A tick for On track, an outlined
        triangle with a bang for At risk, a red cross wrapped in brackets
        for Behind and a clock ring for Overdue. Tally marks in fives draw
        the chart.
    focus: A 2px focus blue outline offset 2px with a soft 5px blue halo.
    tone: Counting-house language, such as Trial balance, Project accounts, Day journal, Folio and Keeper.
